    "summaryAr": "About the team OpenAI’s Scaled Ads team helps mid-market advertisers grow on the platform while protecting user trust. Client Partners own commercial relationships, vendor teams optimise delivery and AI agents take on repeatable work. About the role You’ll win new mid-market advertisers and help them launch a first campaign that can earn a second investment. You own the sale from qualification through a funded launch",
    "descriptionAr": "About the team OpenAI’s Scaled Ads team helps mid-market advertisers grow on the platform while protecting user trust. Client Partners own commercial relationships, vendor teams optimise delivery and AI agents take on repeatable work. About the role You’ll win new mid-market advertisers and help them launch a first campaign that can earn a second investment. You own the sale from qualification through a funded launch. What you’ll do Build a qualified pipeline through outbound prospecting, referrals and inbound demand. Use account signals to focus on buyers with a credible use case. Run discovery with the budget owner, agree a success measure and address the commercial or measurement questions holding up a decision. Negotiate the first commitment and work with the account manager to get the campaign live. Hand the receiving seller the buyer relationship, agreed target and next decision date. Track which sources produce advertisers who return. You might thrive in this role if You’ve closed net-new advertising business and carried a prospecting and revenue target. You can turn an unfamiliar buyer’s objectives into a test they are willing to fund. You maintain a reliable pipeline and can distinguish a signed commitment from a campaign ready to spend. What success looks like New advertisers launch with a measurable goal and a clear owner for the next investment conversation. About OpenAI OpenAI is an AI research and deployment company dedicated to ensuring that general-purpose artificial intelligence benefits all of humanity. We push the boundaries of the capabilities of AI systems and seek to safely deploy them to the world through our products. AI is an extremely powerful tool that must be created with safety and human needs at its core, and to achieve our mission, we must encompass and value the many different perspectives, voices, and experiences that form the full spectrum of humanity. We are an equal opportunity employer, and we do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, color, national origin, sex, sexual orientation, age, veteran status, disability, genetic information, or other applicable legally protected characteristic. For additional information, please see OpenAI’s Affirmative Action and Equal Employment Opportunity Policy Statement . Background checks for applicants will be administered in accordance with applicable law, and qualified applicants with arrest or conviction records will be considered for employment consistent with those laws, including the San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance, the Los Angeles County Fair Chance Ordinance for Employers, and the California Fair Chance Act, for US-based candidates. For unincorporated Los Angeles County workers: we reasonably believe that criminal history may have a direct, adverse and negative relationship with the following job duties, potentially resulting in the withdrawal of a conditional offer of employment: protect computer hardware entrusted to you from theft, loss or damage; return all computer hardware in your possession (including the data contained therein) upon termination of employment or end of assignment; and maintain the confidentiality of proprietary, confidential, and non-public information. In addition, job duties require access to secure and protected information technology systems and related data security obligations. To notify OpenAI that you believe this job posting is non-compliant, please submit a report through this form . No response will be provided to inquiries unrelated to job posting compliance. We are committed to providing reasonable accommodations to applicants with disabilities, and requests can be made via this link . OpenAI Global Applicant Privacy Policy At OpenAI, we believe artificial intelligence has the potential to help people solve immense global challenges, and we want the upside of AI to be widely shared. Join us in shaping the future of technology.",
