    "summaryAr": "About the Team Customer Education helps enterprises build an AI-enabled workforce. We help people develop the skills, confidence and judgment to use AI in their roles, build and deploy AI solutions, and lead changes in how work gets done. About the Role We’re looking for an Advanced User Education Lead to help experienced and ambitious enterprise knowledge workers push further with AI. You’ll turn deep knowledge of O",
    "descriptionAr": "About the Team Customer Education helps enterprises build an AI-enabled workforce. We help people develop the skills, confidence and judgment to use AI in their roles, build and deploy AI solutions, and lead changes in how work gets done. About the Role We’re looking for an Advanced User Education Lead to help experienced and ambitious enterprise knowledge workers push further with AI. You’ll turn deep knowledge of OpenAI’s products and how to use them into practical learning that helps people expand their capabilities and achieve more in their work. You’ll own the learning roadmap for this audience and build, test and deliver the programs yourself. You’ll work with product experts and education partners to help users extend what they can achieve with AI. In this role, you will: Own a learning roadmap that helps enterprise knowledge workers deepen their AI expertise. Build deep product expertise by testing capabilities and finding valuable applications for enterprise knowledge workers. Create practical, reusable learning resources that help users stretch their AI skills through experimentation and practice. Incorporate the latest OpenAI capabilities into practical learning for enterprise knowledge workers. Use learner feedback and usage data to improve learning and assess skills and sustained product use. You might thrive in this role if you: Have independently built, delivered and improved learning programs that helped people deepen their expertise at work. Use AI extensively, experiment with new capabilities and love helping others get more from it. Have turned complex concepts into clear explanations and guided practice for different skill levels. Are a strong writer and facilitator who can create engaging learning and teach live. Have delivered programs across product and customer-facing teams while navigating ambiguity and changing priorities. Use learner feedback and usage data to decide what to build, improve or stop. Nice to have Experience with enterprise workforce learning or customer education in a fast-moving technology environment. Experience developing learning for professional audiences with different goals and levels of expertise. What success looks like Learners apply new AI capabilities to more demanding work and achieve better results. Learning programs contribute to sustained product use and increased credit consumption. About OpenAI OpenAI is an AI research and deployment company dedicated to ensuring that general-purpose artificial intelligence benefits all of humanity. We push the boundaries of the capabilities of AI systems and seek to safely deploy them to the world through our products. AI is an extremely powerful tool that must be created with safety and human needs at its core, and to achieve our mission, we must encompass and value the many different perspectives, voices, and experiences that form the full spectrum of humanity. We are an equal opportunity employer, and we do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, color, national origin, sex, sexual orientation, age, veteran status, disability, genetic information, or other applicable legally protected characteristic. For additional information, please see OpenAI’s Affirmative Action and Equal Employment Opportunity Policy Statement . Background checks for applicants will be administered in accordance with applicable law, and qualified applicants with arrest or conviction records will be considered for employment consistent with those laws, including the San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance, the Los Angeles County Fair Chance Ordinance for Employers, and the California Fair Chance Act, for US-based candidates. For unincorporated Los Angeles County workers: we reasonably believe that criminal history may have a direct, adverse and negative relationship with the following job duties, potentially resulting in the withdrawal of a conditional offer of employment: protect computer hardware entrusted to you from theft, loss or damage; return all computer hardware in your possession (including the data contained therein) upon termination of employment or end of assignment; and maintain the confidentiality of proprietary, confidential, and non-public information. In addition, job duties require access to secure and protected information technology systems and related data security obligations. To notify OpenAI that you believe this job posting is non-compliant, please submit a report through this form . No response will be provided to inquiries unrelated to job posting compliance. We are committed to providing reasonable accommodations to applicants with disabilities, and requests can be made via this link . OpenAI Global Applicant Privacy Policy At OpenAI, we believe artificial intelligence has the potential to help people solve immense global challenges, and we want the upside of AI to be widely shared. Join us in shaping the future of technology.",
